  "details": "Running all programs on new computer. Steam program with latest update, VRChat program with latest update and Steam vr with latest beta update 1.4.3. During login process login screen will travel slowly around circle then stop three quarters of the way through and not finish. When i'm lucky enough to actually login, it takes me to home screen where everything just stops. I can't choose any avatars or worlds or friends. Worlds, friends or avatars don't show up on screen. You only have the menu screen available to you and that locks up most of the time. I tried clearing cache, going back to original steam vr instead of beta and nothing has fixed this problem. What are my options to fix this problem?",
